    "reason": "DESI DR2 (the DR3/Y5 release's predecessor) was published on 2025-03-19, ~7 months before the Y3 preregistration timestamp 2025-11-21T08:18:58Z. The Y3 predictions were therefore not preregistered with respect to DR2 and have been retired. The numerical predictions were computed on a clean theoretical grid z in {0.30,0.50,...,1.70}, not on DR2's actual bin centers, so the Y3 file was a labeling/timing failure rather than a curve-fit-to-data; nevertheless, it cannot be cited as preregistration and is superseded by this Y5 file."
