    "pipeline_commit_note": "Predictions emitted from pipeline.bao.bao_pipeline.BAOPipeline. A pre-existing (1+z)^(2/3) factor in _calculate_theoretical_DV_rs was corrected to match Eisenstein 2005 before this run; see commit log for the correction. The fix does not affect D_M/r_d or D_H/r_d predictions."
